  "notes": "No webhooks, no batch operations, no multi-currency conversion in v1. All amounts are integer minor units. Idempotency conflicts must be treated as terminal errors and surfaced as distinct exception types. For mutating operations, idempotency_key is required; for read operations, it is ignored. Authentication_failed may trigger one token refresh followed by a single re-sign attempt before surfacing the error. Clients must emit metrics per operation per outcome class using the template ledgerbridge.<operation>.<outcome>. Timeout defaults: 10 seconds for writes, 5 seconds for reads. Retries on timeout are only permitted for mutating operations when idempotency_key is guaranteed to be present.",
